<xs:schema xmlns:xs="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" elementFormDefault="qualified"><xs:element name="RemessaAcaoOrcamentaria" nillable="true" type="RemessaAcaoOrcamentaria" /><xs:complexType name="RemessaAcaoOrcamentaria"><xs:sequence><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="AcoesOrcamentarias" nillable="true" type="ArrayOfAcaoOrcamentaria" /></xs:sequence></xs:complexType><xs:complexType name="ArrayOfAcaoOrcamentaria"><xs:sequence><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="unbounded" name="AcaoOrcamentaria" nillable="true" type="AcaoOrcamentaria" /></xs:sequence></xs:complexType><xs:complexType name="AcaoOrcamentaria"><xs:all><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="Identificador" type="xs:int" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Este campo é aberto, admitindo qualquer numeração que tenha sido utilizada na identificação do registro para efeitos de controle. Geralmente, utiliza-se um número sequencial dentro de cada processo. Ou seja: identificador 01, identificador  02, etc. - Campos que compõem a chave primária do arquivo:  TipoProjetoAtividade,  Funcao,  Programa,  SubFuncao,  Codigo,  Ano. </xs:documentation></xs:annotation></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="CodigoUnidadeGestora" type="xs:int" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Código da Unidade Gestora.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="Ano" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Ano.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation><xs:simpleType><xs:restriction base="xs:int"><xs:pattern value="[0-9]{4}" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="TipoAcao" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Tipo de Ação.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation><xs:simpleType><xs:restriction base="xs:string"><xs:maxLength value="20" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="CodigoAcao" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Código da Ação.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation><xs:simpleType><xs:restriction base="xs:string"><xs:maxLength value="20" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="Descricao" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Descrição.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation><xs:simpleType><xs:restriction base="xs:string"><xs:maxLength value="250" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="Produto" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Produto(bem ou serviço).</xs:documentation></xs:annotation><xs:simpleType><xs:restriction base="xs:string"><xs:maxLength value="250" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="Funcao" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Código da Função.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation><xs:simpleType><xs:restriction base="xs:string"><xs:maxLength value="20" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="SubFuncao" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Código da SubFunção.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation><xs:simpleType><xs:restriction base="xs:string"><xs:maxLength value="20" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="Programa" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Código do Programa.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation><xs:simpleType><xs:restriction base="xs:string"><xs:maxLength value="20" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="UnidadeMedida" type="xs:int" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Código da Unidade de Medida.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="Meta" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Descrição da Meta.</xs:documentation></xs:annotation><xs:simpleType><xs:restriction base="xs:string"><xs:maxLength value="250" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="PlanoOrcamentario" nillable="true"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Plano Orçamentário (PO) associado à ação. Campo gerencial de texto livre para detalhar como os valores da ação se distribuem entre públicos prioritários (ex.: primeira infância, adolescentes, mulheres, pessoas com deficiência). Campo opcional. Ex.: "Foco em creches e pré-escolas (PI)", "Atenção à infância e adolescência em saúde".</xs:documentation></xs:annotation><xs:simpleType><xs:restriction base="xs:string"><xs:maxLength value="500" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="Beneficiarios" nillable="true" type="ArrayOfBeneficiario"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Lista de Beneficiários</xs:documentation></xs:annotation></xs:element></xs:all></xs:complexType><xs:complexType name="ArrayOfBeneficiario"><xs:sequence><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="unbounded" name="Beneficiario" nillable="true" type="Beneficiario" /></xs:sequence></xs:complexType><xs:complexType name="Beneficiario"><xs:sequence><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="Identificador" type="xs:int" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Este campo é aberto, admitindo qualquer numeração que tenha sido utilizada na identificação do registro para efeitos de controle. Geralmente, utiliza-se um número sequencial dentro de cada processo. Ou seja: identificador 01, identificador  02, etc. - Campos que compõem a chave primária do arquivo:  ProjetoAtividade,  Percentual,  TipoBeneficiarioProjetoAtividade. </xs:documentation></xs:annotation></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="Percentual" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Percentual da ação destinado à Primeira Infância (0 a 6 anos incompletos) / Infância e Adolescência (0 a 18 anos incompletos) . Informe um valor de 0 a 100 usando vírgula como separador decimal (ex.: 40,5).</xs:documentation></xs:annotation><xs:simpleType><xs:restriction base="xs:decimal"><xs:maxInclusive value="1" /><xs:minInclusive value="0" /><xs:fractionDigits value="2" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:element><xs:element minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" name="TipoBeneficiario" type="EnumTipoBeneficiarioProjetoAtividade" nillable="false"><xs:annotation><xs:documentation>Tipo de Percentual aplicado. 1 = Primeira Infância, 2 =Infância/Adolescências</xs:documentation></xs:annotation></xs:element></xs:sequence></xs:complexType><xs:simpleType name="EnumTipoBeneficiarioProjetoAtividade"><xs:restriction base="xs:string"><xs:enumeration value="1" /><xs:enumeration value="2" /></xs:restriction></xs:simpleType></xs:schema>